# Prototyping

Prototypes are built in this workspace at `./prototypes/<feature-name>/`, NOT in the sandbox.

When working on prototype files:

- Build all prototype files here in `./prototypes/`
- Read components and design tokens from `../prototype-sandbox/` (read-only)
- Read `../prototype-sandbox/CLAUDE.md` for design system rules
- Every prototype needs: state simulation (loading, error, empty), realistic sample data
- Generate PLACEMENT.md alongside the prototype
- Use the `/create-prototype` skill for scaffolding
